# IDE Assistant Rules for ToDo-AI Project

This document is imported by `.claude` to provide comprehensive IDE assistant guidance.

## Quick Reference

- **Language**: Java 17
- **Framework**: Spring Boot 3.2.3
- **Build Tool**: Maven
- **Package Root**: `com.todoai`
- **API Base**: `/api/v1`
- **Database**: H2 (development)

## File Organization

```
.
├── .claude                          # Main Claude configuration (with @imports)
├── .claude-config.md                # Project configuration
├── .claude-skills.md                # Skills & capabilities
├── .claude-architecture.md          # Architecture patterns
├── .claude-conventions.md           # Coding standards
├── .claude-features.md              # Features & roadmap
├── .cursorules                      # This file - IDE rules
├── src/main/java/com/todoai/
│   ├── ToDoAiApplication.java
│   ├── config/                      # Spring configuration
│   ├── controller/                  # REST endpoints
│   ├── service/                     # Business logic
│   ├── repository/                  # Data access
│   ├── model/                       # JPA entities
│   ├── dto/                         # Data transfer objects
│   └── mapper/                      # Entity-DTO mapping
├── src/main/resources/
│   ├── application.properties       # Main configuration
│   ├── application-dev.properties   # Dev profile
│   └── application-prod.properties  # Prod profile
├── pom.xml                          # Maven configuration
└── README.md                        # Project documentation
```

