## Development Workflow

### 1. Starting Development
```bash
cd /Users/maksim_evmenenko/Projects/ToDo-AI
mvn clean install
mvn spring-boot:run
```

### 2. Testing an Endpoint
```bash
curl http://localhost:8080/api/v1/todo/list
```

### 3. Making Code Changes
1. Edit files in `src/main/java/com/todoai/`
2. Spring Boot hot-reloads changes
3. Test with curl or Postman

### 4. Building for Deployment
```bash
mvn clean package
```

